// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ArmortailStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1968565548" "Agent Armortail's story"
// DetailString :
"P310005660" "When you defeated Agent Armortail, he snarled: <br><br>'Daos may think he's got the Scorpion Gang on the run, but he'll never take down all of us. No, sir. We know the secrets of  Project Fury, and soon all of Malta will know!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DuneStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4247702257" "Agent Dune's story"
// DetailString :
"P1739276367" "When you defeated Agent Dune, he snapped: <br><br>'You may have got me. You may have got Armortail. But you'll never touch Deathstalker. He's invincible!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DeathstalkerStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1649044726" "Agent Deathstalker's story"
// DetailString :
"P3233011858" "When you defeated Agent Deathstalker, he said: <br><br>'I just can't believe it. I knew Dad was steamed that we came after Project Fury's secrets, but... I never thought he'd send someone like you after his own son.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2346166092" "Absolute Vengeance"
// DetailString :
"P92645349" "It began with a request from Arbiter Daos. He had learned of a crime perpetrated against Arachnos by an elite cell of Malta operatives known as the Scorpion Gang. Arbiter Daos resolved to eliminate them, so he sent you after one of their members: Agent Armortail. You defeated Armortail, and learned the nature of the gang's crime: they had stolen classified information about Project Fury."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P2283385812" "It began with a request from Arbiter Daos. He had learned of a crime perpetrated against Arachnos by an elite cell of Malta operatives known as the Scorpion Gang. Arbiter Daos resolved to eliminate them, so he sent you after one of their members: Agent Armortail. You defeated Armortail, and learned the nature of the gang's crime: they had stolen classified information about Project Fury. <br><br>Daos next sent you after Agent Dune, who had gone to ground with some allies in the Council. You eliminated Dune, who spoke of the group's leader: Deathstalker, a man he claimed was invincible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL8_SV_Daos_MiniArc2_Souvenir 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P2579218294" "Agent Deathstalker's hat"
// tDetailString :
"P3835112770" "Though you've put the whole ugly business behind you, somehow you can't bring yourself to throw away Agent Deathstalker's hat. It's a chilling reminder of the adventure you like to call: <br><br>Absolute Vengeance <br><br>It began with a request from Arbiter Daos. He had learned of a crime perpetrated against Arachnos by an elite cell of Malta operatives known as the Scorpion Gang. Arbiter Daos resolved to eliminate them, so he sent you after one of their members: Agent Armortail. You defeated Armortail, and learned the nature of the gang's crime: they had stolen classified information about Project Fury. <br><br>Daos next sent you after Agent Dune, who had gone to ground with some allies in the Council. You eliminated Dune, who spoke of the group's leader: Deathstalker, a man he claimed was invincible. <br><br>Deathstalker was your next target. You eliminated the Malta agent, but were shocked to discover that you had been sent against Arbiter Daos' own son! Though Daos regretted his actions, he believed he had no choice but to exact Arachnos' vengeance in equal measure against foe and family alike. Your obedience to his cause has resulted in the termination of your relationship with Daos, as he can no longer bear to look at your face."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P208042222" "You have punished the Knives of Artemis who were responsible for the assault on Arachnos. So, you are familiar with my methods. I will allow no one to interfere with Arachnos without paying in blood. As it happens, I have more punishment to exact today. This time it is against an elite corps of operatives within the Malta Group. They call themselves the Scorpion Gang, and they have perpetrated a most vile crime. You, {VillainName}, will track down each of the Scorpion Gang's members and see to it that they are in no position to threaten Arachnos again."
// AcceptString :
"P531720488" "Track down the Scorpion Gang"
// SendOffString :
"P2670345371" "The first person I want you to track is known as Agent Armortail. He is a dangerous man. You will have to be prudent and clever to take him down."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2118598659" "Defeat Armortail & his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P332749191" "You have a job to do, {VillainName}.  It may not be a pleasant job, but you must do it nevertheless."

