// Dialog :
"P2436488938" "So. It is done. Yes, {VillainName}, you have learned the truth, and I will not deny it: Agent Deathstalker was indeed my son. I would have liked nothing better than to spare him, but Arachnos' vengeance must be absolute. Otherwise, the entire great organization on which I have based my life might tumble, like so many playing cards. <br><br>Please, leave me now, {VillainName}. I have done what I must, but I cannot bear to look on your face any longer."
